concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-3a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3A Application of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-3a ;
    values:originalText "Chapter 2 of the Criminal Code (except Part 2.5) applies to all offences against this Act. Note: Chapter 2 of the Criminal Code sets out the general principles of criminal responsibility." ;
    skos:definition "Chapter 2 of the Criminal Code (except Part 2.5) applies to all offences against this Act. Note: Chapter 2 of the Criminal Code sets out the general principles of criminal responsibility."@en ;
