er of the individual; and  (b) another individual if a relationship referred to in paragraph (a) can be traced through a parent of either or both of the individuals. stepchild: without limiting who is a stepchild of an individual, someone is a stepchild of an individual if he or she would be the individual’s stepchild except that the individual is not legally married to the individual’s de facto partner." ;
