rs or employees that is registered or recognised under a law of a State or Territory dealing with the resolution of industrial disputes; or  (d) a body established or appointed, otherwise than by or under a law of a State or Territory, by:  (i) a Governor of a State; or  (ii) the Australian Capital Territory Executive; or  (iii) the Administrator of the Northern Territory; or  (v) a State or Territory Minister; or  (e) a person holding or performing the duties of an office established by or under, or an appointment made under, a law of a State or Territory, other than the office of head of a State or Territory Department (however described); or" ;
