doc:sch-2-sec-6e-ss-1d a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "6E(1D) Small business operator treated as organisation" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1D) If a small business operator holds an accreditation under subsection 56CA(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010, this Act applies, with the prescribed modifications (if any), in relation to information that:  (a) is personal information; but  (b) is not CDR data (within the meaning of that Act); as if the small business operator were an organisation. Note: The regulations may prescribe different modifications of the Act for different small business operators. See subsection 33(3A) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901. Regulations treating a small business operator as an organisation" ;
    cof:pageNumber "62"^^xsd:integer .

