concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-6fa a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6FA Meaning of health information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-6fa ;
    values:originalText "The following information is health information:  (a) information or an opinion about:  (i) the health, including an illness, disability or injury, (at any time) of an individual; or  (ii) an individual’s expressed wishes about the future provision of health services to the individual; or   Interpretation  Part II General definitions  Division 1  Section 6FB  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (iii) a health service provided, or to be provided, to an individual;  that is also personal information;  (b) other personal information collected to provide, or in providing, a health service to an individual;  (c) other personal information collected in connection with the donation, or intended donation, by an individual of his or her body parts, organs or body substances;  (d) genetic information about an individual in a form that is, or could be, predictive of the health of the individual or a genetic relative of the individual." ;
    skos:definition "The following information is health information:  (a) information or an opinion about:  (i) the health, including an illness, disability or injury, (at any time) of an individual; or  (ii) an individual’s expressed wishes about the future provision of health services to the individual; or   Interpretation  Part II General definitions  Division 1  Section 6FB  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (iii) a health service provided, or to be provided, to an individual;  that is also personal information;  (b) other personal information collected to provide, or in providing, a health service to an individual;  (c) other personal information collected in connection with the donation, or intended donation, by an individual of his or her body parts, organs or body substances;  (d) genetic information about an individual in a form that is, or could be, predictive of the health of the individual or a genetic relative of the individual."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9e8303f54251fac9adc67885abb9afe4ed79aa2aeb75bc0ff7e5087a56b81746" ;
    cof:pageNumber "66"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defines health information" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <entries-found-privacy-act-1988.pdf> ;
    dc:source "entries-found-privacy-act-1988.pdf, p.66" ;
