concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-6u a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6U Meaning of personal insolvency information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-6u ;
    values:originalText "(1) Personal insolvency information about an individual is information:  (a) that is entered or recorded in the National Personal Insolvency Index; and  (b) that relates to:  (i) a bankruptcy of the individual; or  (ii) a debt agreement proposal given by the individual; or  (iii) a debt agreement made by the individual; or  (iv) a personal insolvency agreement executed by the individual; or" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Personal insolvency information about an individual is information:  (a) that is entered or recorded in the National Personal Insolvency Index; and  (b) that relates to:  (i) a bankruptcy of the individual; or  (ii) a debt agreement proposal given by the individual; or  (iii) a debt agreement made by the individual; or  (iv) a personal insolvency agreement executed by the individual; or"@en ;
