doc:sch-2-sec-6v-ss-1a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "6V(1A) Meaning of repayment history information" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1A) If an obligation of the individual to make a monthly payment is, or is taken by subsection (1B) to be, affected by a financial hardship arrangement, then repayment history information is to be determined by reference to that obligation as so affected. Note: In this case, there may be financial hardship information: see subsections 6QA(4) and (5).   Interpretation  Part II Key definitions relating to credit reporting  Division 2  Section 6V  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
