concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-7c-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7C(6) Political acts and practices are exempt"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-7c-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) In this section: electoral law means a law of the Commonwealth, or a law of a State or Territory, relating to elections to a Parliament or to a local government authority. Parliament means:" ;
