concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-12b-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12B(5) Severability—additional effect of this Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-12b-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) This Act also has the effect it would have if its operation in relation to regulated entities were expressly confined to acts or practices of regulated entities taking place in the course of, or in relation to, trade or commerce:   Interpretation  Part II Other matters  Division 3  Section 12B  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (a) between Australia and places outside Australia; or  (b) among the States; or  (c) within a Territory, between a State and a Territory or between 2 Territories." ;
    skos:definition "(5) This Act also has the effect it would have if its operation in relation to regulated entities were expressly confined to acts or practices of regulated entities taking place in the course of, or in relation to, trade or commerce:   Interpretation  Part II Other matters  Division 3  Section 12B  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (a) between Australia and places outside Australia; or  (b) among the States; or  (c) within a Territory, between a State and a Territory or between 2 Territories."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "237f5d1f44cb178a437782db18eca194ed75f32595a956a789d84e890763198e" ;
    values:partOf concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-12b ;
    cof:pageNumber "96"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Expressly confine operation to acts or practices of regulated entities taking place in the course of, or in relation to, trade or commerce." ;
