doc:sch-2-sec-13b-ss-1a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "13B(1A) Related bodies corporate" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1A) However, paragraph (1)(a) does not apply to the collection by a body corporate of personal information (other than sensitive information) from:  (a) a related body corporate that is not an organisation; or  (b) a related body corporate whose disclosure of the information to the body corporate is an exempt act or exempt practice for the purposes of paragraph 7(1)(ee); or  (c) a related body corporate whose disclosure of the information to the body corporate is not an interference with privacy because of section 13D.   Information privacy  Part III Interferences with privacy  Division 1  Section 13C  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Note: The effect of subsection (1A) is that a body corporate’s failure to comply with the Australian Privacy Principles, or a registered APP code that binds the body, in collecting personal information about an individual from a related body corporate covered by that subsection is an interference with the privacy of the individual. Relationship with subsection 13(3)" ;
    cof:pageNumber "100"^^xsd:integer .

concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-13b-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "13B(2) Related bodies corporate"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-13b-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Subsection (1) does not prevent an act or practice of an organisation from being an interference with the privacy of an individual under subsection 13(3)." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Subsection (1) does not prevent an act or practice of an organisation from being an interference with the privacy of an individual under subsection 13(3)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ef5d19756ea2050a2873e67ca370cbf196ad31597ba611ca840f5821eb106f17" ;
    values:partOf concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-13b ;
    cof:pageNumber "100"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Organisation's act or practice may be an interference with individual's privacy." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <entries-found-privacy-act-1988.pdf> ;
    dc:source "entries-found-privacy-act-1988.pdf, p.100" ;
