concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-16a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16A Permitted general situations in relation to the collection, use or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-16a ;
    values:originalText "disclosure of personal information  (1) A permitted general situation exists in relation to the collection, use or disclosure by an APP entity of personal information about an individual, or of a government related identifier of an individual, if:  (a) the entity is an entity of a kind specified in an item in column 1 of the table; and  (b) the item in column 2 of the table applies to the information or identifier; and   Information privacy  Part III Australian Privacy Principles  Division 2  Section 16A  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (c) such conditions as are specified in the item in column 3 of the table are satisfied.  Permitted general situations Item Column 1 Kind of entity Column 2 Item applies to Column 3 Condition(s) APP entity (a) personal information; or (b) a government related identifier. (a) it is unreasonable or impracticable to obtain the individual’s consent to the collection, use or disclosure; and (b) the entity reasonably believes that the collection, use or disclosure is necessary to lessen or prevent a serious threat to the life, health or safety of any individual, or to public health or safety. APP entity (a) personal information; or (b) a government related identifier. (a) the entity has reason to suspect that unlawful activity, or misconduct of a serious nature, that relates to the entity’s functions or activities has been, is being or may be engaged in; and (b) the entity reasonably believes that the collection, use or disclosure is necessary in order for the entity to take appropriate action in relation to the matter. APP entity Personal information (a) the entity reasonably believes that the collection, use or disclosure is reasonably necessary to assist any APP entity, body or person to locate a person who has been reported as missing; and (b) the collection, use or disclosure complies with the rules made under subsection (2)." ;
    skos:definition "disclosure of personal information  (1) A permitted general situation exists in relation to the collection, use or disclosure by an APP entity of personal information about an individual, or of a government related identifier of an individual, if:  (a) the entity is an entity of a kind specified in an item in column 1 of the table; and  (b) the item in column 2 of the table applies to the information or identifier; and   Information privacy  Part III Australian Privacy Principles  Division 2  Section 16A  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (c) such conditions as are specified in the item in column 3 of the table are satisfied.  Permitted general situations Item Column 1 Kind of entity Column 2 Item applies to Column 3 Condition(s) APP entity (a) personal information; or (b) a government related identifier. (a) it is unreasonable or impracticable to obtain the individual’s consent to the collection, use or disclosure; and (b) the entity reasonably believes that the collection, use or disclosure is necessary to lessen or prevent a serious threat to the life, health or safety of any individual, or to public health or safety. APP entity (a) personal information; or (b) a government related identifier. (a) the entity has reason to suspect that unlawful activity, or misconduct of a serious nature, that relates to the entity’s functions or activities has been, is being or may be engaged in; and (b) the entity reasonably believes that the collection, use or disclosure is necessary in order for the entity to take appropriate action in relation to the matter. APP entity Personal information (a) the entity reasonably believes that the collection, use or disclosure is reasonably necessary to assist any APP entity, body or person to locate a person who has been reported as missing; and (b) the collection, use or disclosure complies with the rules made under subsection (2)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "abd0825ccc734206afa65e82e6a86476474e061a3de3d1175336d104161752cf" ;
    cof:pageNumber "108"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Permitted general situations for collection, use or disclosure of personal information" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
