concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-20g-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20G(3) Use or disclosure of credit reporting information for the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-20g-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) In assessing under paragraph (2)(d) whether or not the individual is eligible to receive the direct marketing communications of the credit provider, the credit reporting body must have regard to the eligibility requirements nominated by the provider." ;
