concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-20k a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20K No use or disclosure of credit reporting information during a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-20k ;
    values:originalText "ban period  (1) If:  (a) a credit reporting body holds credit reporting information about an individual; and  (b) the individual believes on reasonable grounds that the individual has been, or is likely to be, a victim of fraud (including identity fraud); and  (c) the individual requests the body not to use or disclose the information under this Division;" ;
    skos:definition "ban period  (1) If:  (a) a credit reporting body holds credit reporting information about an individual; and  (b) the individual believes on reasonable grounds that the individual has been, or is likely to be, a victim of fraud (including identity fraud); and  (c) the individual requests the body not to use or disclose the information under this Division;"@en ;
