concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-20m a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20M Use or disclosure of credit reporting information that is"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-20m ;
    values:originalText "de-identified Use or disclosure  (1) If:  (a) a credit reporting body holds credit reporting information; and  (b) the information (the de-identified information) is de-identified; the body must not use or disclose the de-identified information." ;
