doc:sch-2-sec-20v-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "20V(4) Destruction etc. of credit reporting information after the" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) Subsection (2) does not apply if the credit reporting body is required by or under an Australian law, or a court/tribunal order, to retain the credit information.   Credit reporting  Part IIIA Credit reporting bodies  Division 2  Section 20W  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Destruction etc. of CRB derived information" ;
