    values:originalText "(2) The credit reporting body must, as soon as practicable, notify in writing the Commissioner of the matter referred to in paragraph (1)(a) or (b) of this section. Civil penalty: 1,000 penalty units.   Credit reporting  Part IIIA Credit reporting bodies  Division 2  Section 20ZA  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Use or disclosure" ;
