concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-20z-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "20Z(4) Dealing with information if there is a pending correction"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-20z-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) However, the credit reporting body may use or disclose the information under this subsection if:  (a) the use or disclosure is for the purposes of the pending correction request, or pending dispute, in relation to the information; or  (b) the use or disclosure of the information is required by or under an Australian law or a court/tribunal order." ;
    skos:definition "(4) However, the credit reporting body may use or disclose the information under this subsection if:  (a) the use or disclosure is for the purposes of the pending correction request, or pending dispute, in relation to the information; or  (b) the use or disclosure of the information is required by or under an Australian law or a court/tribunal order."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "231d72a2ceaaed61846285da01d65b406759621997fbc47f2bfd90425e748d8a" ;
    values:partOf concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-20z ;
    cof:pageNumber "146"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Use or disclose information for pending correction request or dispute, or under Australian law or court order." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
