doc:sch-2-sec-21d-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "21D(1) Disclosure of credit information to a credit reporting body" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A credit provider must not disclose credit information about an individual to a credit reporting body (whether or not the body’s credit reporting business is carried on in Australia). Civil penalty: 2,000 penalty units. Permitted disclosure" ;
    cof:pageNumber "153"^^xsd:integer .

concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-21d-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21D(2) Disclosure of credit information to a credit reporting body"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-21d-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply to the disclosure of credit information about the individual if:  (a) the credit provider:  (i) is a member of or subject to a recognised external dispute resolution scheme or is prescribed by the regulations; and  (ii) knows, or believes on reasonable grounds, that the individual is at least 18 years old; and  (b) the credit reporting body is:  (i) an agency; or  (ii) an organisation that has an Australian link; and  (c) the information meets the requirements of subsection (3). Note: Section 21F limits the disclosure of credit information if there is a ban period for the information." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply to the disclosure of credit information about the individual if:  (a) the credit provider:  (i) is a member of or subject to a recognised external dispute resolution scheme or is prescribed by the regulations; and  (ii) knows, or believes on reasonable grounds, that the individual is at least 18 years old; and  (b) the credit reporting body is:  (i) an agency; or  (ii) an organisation that has an Australian link; and  (c) the information meets the requirements of subsection (3). Note: Section 21F limits the disclosure of credit information if there is a ban period for the information."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0daed9ea73899868698f87dd63266a560c09d724784f41b2496d7bc14891d757" ;
    values:partOf concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-21d ;
    cof:pageNumber "153"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Disclosure of credit information to a credit reporting body is permitted under certain conditions." ;
