concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-21f-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21F(3) Limitation on the disclosure of credit information during a ban"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-21f-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Subsection (2) does not apply if the credit provider has taken such steps as are reasonable in the circumstances to verify the identity of the individual. Subdivision D—Dealing with credit eligibility information etc." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Subsection (2) does not apply if the credit provider has taken such steps as are reasonable in the circumstances to verify the identity of the individual. Subdivision D—Dealing with credit eligibility information etc."@en ;
