    values:originalText "(1) If a credit provider holds credit eligibility information about an individual, the provider must not use or disclose the information. Civil penalty: 2,000 penalty units.   Credit reporting  Part IIIA Credit providers  Division 3  Section 21G  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Permitted uses" ;
