    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-21w-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the credit provider does not correct the personal information under subsection 21V(2), the provider must, within a reasonable period, give the individual written notice that:  (a) states that the correction has not been made; and   Credit reporting  Part IIIA Credit providers  Division 3  Section 21W  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (b) sets out the provider’s reasons for not correcting the information (including evidence substantiating the correctness of the information); and  (c) states that, if the individual is not satisfied with the response to the request, the individual may:  (i) access a recognised external dispute resolution scheme of which the provider is a member or to which it is subject; or  (ii) make a complaint to the Commissioner under Part V. Exceptions" ;
    skos:definition "(3) If the credit provider does not correct the personal information under subsection 21V(2), the provider must, within a reasonable period, give the individual written notice that:  (a) states that the correction has not been made; and   Credit reporting  Part IIIA Credit providers  Division 3  Section 21W  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (b) sets out the provider’s reasons for not correcting the information (including evidence substantiating the correctness of the information); and  (c) states that, if the individual is not satisfied with the response to the request, the individual may:  (i) access a recognised external dispute resolution scheme of which the provider is a member or to which it is subject; or  (ii) make a complaint to the Commissioner under Part V. Exceptions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "593b0eef02ea4914908e9a17a53c71da35640f07ae2a18e8e1fb9b6fa67c0880" ;
    values:partOf concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-21w ;
    cof:pageNumber "176"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Correct personal information within a reasonable period" ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
