doc:sch-2-sec-22a-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "22A(1) Open and transparent management of regulated information" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The object of this section is to ensure that an affected information recipient manages the regulated information of the recipient in an open and transparent way. Compliance with this Division etc." ;
    cof:pageNumber "178"^^xsd:integer .

concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-22a-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22A(2) Open and transparent management of regulated information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-22a-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) An affected information recipient must take such steps as are reasonable in the circumstances to implement practices, procedures and systems relating to the recipient’s functions or activities that:  (a) will ensure that the recipient complies with this Division and the registered CR code if it binds the recipient; and  (b) will enable the recipient to deal with inquiries or complaints from individuals about the recipient’s compliance with this Division or the registered CR code if it binds the recipient.   Credit reporting  Part IIIA Affected information recipients  Division 4  Section 22A  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Policy about the management of regulated information" ;
    skos:definition "(2) An affected information recipient must take such steps as are reasonable in the circumstances to implement practices, procedures and systems relating to the recipient’s functions or activities that:  (a) will ensure that the recipient complies with this Division and the registered CR code if it binds the recipient; and  (b) will enable the recipient to deal with inquiries or complaints from individuals about the recipient’s compliance with this Division or the registered CR code if it binds the recipient.   Credit reporting  Part IIIA Affected information recipients  Division 4  Section 22A  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Policy about the management of regulated information"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6d416aea7800486892dd78c8e36ec52abbdee7419edf0c69fd1bd07ef59809ea" ;
    values:partOf concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-22a ;
