concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-22a-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22A(5) Open and transparent management of regulated information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-22a-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) An affected information recipient must take such steps as are reasonable in the circumstances to make the policy available:  (a) free of charge; and  (b) in such form as is appropriate. Note: An affected information recipient will usually make the policy available on the recipient’s website." ;
    skos:definition "(5) An affected information recipient must take such steps as are reasonable in the circumstances to make the policy available:  (a) free of charge; and  (b) in such form as is appropriate. Note: An affected information recipient will usually make the policy available on the recipient’s website."@en ;
