doc:sch-2-sec-23 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "23 Guide to this Division" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "This Division deals with complaints about credit reporting bodies or credit providers. Individuals may complain to credit reporting bodies or credit providers about acts or practices that may be a breach of certain provisions of this Part or the registered CR code. If a complaint is made, the respondent for the complaint must investigate the complaint and make a decision about the complaint." ;
    cof:pageNumber "186"^^xsd:integer .

concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-23a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23A Individual may complain about a breach of a provision of this"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-23a ;
    values:originalText "Part etc. Complaint  (1) An individual may complain to a credit reporting body about an act or practice engaged in by the body that may be a breach of either of the following provisions in relation to the individual:  (a) a provision of this Part (other than section 20R or 20T);  (b) a provision of the registered CR code (other than a provision that relates to that section). Note: A complaint about a breach of section 20R or 20T, or a provision of the registered CR code that relates to that section, may be made to the Commissioner under Part V.  (2) An individual may complain to a credit provider about an act or practice engaged in by the provider that may be a breach of either of the following provisions in relation to the individual:  (a) a provision of this Part (other than section 21T or 21V);  (b) a provision of the registered CR code (other than a provision that relates to that section) if it binds the credit provider.   Credit reporting  Part IIIA Complaints  Division 5  Section 23B  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Note: A complaint about a breach of section 21T or 21V, or a provision of the registered CR code that relates to that section, may be made to the Commissioner under Part V. Nature of complaint  (3) If an individual makes a complaint, the individual must specify the nature of the complaint.  (4) The complaint may relate to personal information that has been destroyed or de-identified. No charge  (5) The credit reporting body or credit provider must not charge the individual for the making of the complaint or for dealing with the complaint." ;
    skos:definition "Part etc. Complaint  (1) An individual may complain to a credit reporting body about an act or practice engaged in by the body that may be a breach of either of the following provisions in relation to the individual:  (a) a provision of this Part (other than section 20R or 20T);  (b) a provision of the registered CR code (other than a provision that relates to that section). Note: A complaint about a breach of section 20R or 20T, or a provision of the registered CR code that relates to that section, may be made to the Commissioner under Part V.  (2) An individual may complain to a credit provider about an act or practice engaged in by the provider that may be a breach of either of the following provisions in relation to the individual:  (a) a provision of this Part (other than section 21T or 21V);  (b) a provision of the registered CR code (other than a provision that relates to that section) if it binds the credit provider.   Credit reporting  Part IIIA Complaints  Division 5  Section 23B  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Note: A complaint about a breach of section 21T or 21V, or a provision of the registered CR code that relates to that section, may be made to the Commissioner under Part V. Nature of complaint  (3) If an individual makes a complaint, the individual must specify the nature of the complaint.  (4) The complaint may relate to personal information that has been destroyed or de-identified. No charge  (5) The credit reporting body or credit provider must not charge the individual for the making of the complaint or for dealing with the complaint."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f6e464f9e9504f399cffecee8c5fa1d2e468ca1d313db515d6c475f6293bd6c6" ;
    cof:pageNumber "186"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-23a-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-23a-ss-2 ;
