    values:originalText "(1) An entity commits an offence if:  (a) the entity obtains credit reporting information; and  (b) the information is obtained from a credit reporting body; and  (c) the entity is not:  (i) an entity to which the body is permitted to disclose the information under Division 2 of this Part; or  (ii) an access seeker for the information. Penalty: 200 penalty units." ;
