    values:originalText "(1) An entity commits an offence if:  (a) the entity obtains credit eligibility information; and  (b) the information is obtained from a credit provider; and  (c) the entity is not:  (i) an entity to which the provider is permitted to disclose the information under Division 3 of this Part; or  (ii) an access seeker for the information. Penalty: 200 penalty units." ;
    cof:pageNumber "192"^^xsd:integer .

