doc:sch-2-sec-26gb-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "26GB(1) Development of APP codes by the Commissioner—temporary" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, in writing, direct the Commissioner to develop an APP code (a temporary APP code) if the Minister is satisfied that:  (a) it is in the public interest:  (i) to develop the code; and  (ii) for the Commissioner to develop the code; and  (b) the code should be developed urgently." ;
    cof:pageNumber "204"^^xsd:integer .

concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26gb-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26GB(2) Development of APP codes by the Commissioner—temporary"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-26gb-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a direction under that subsection may:  (a) specify one or more matters that the code must deal with; and  (b) specify the APP entities, or a class of APP entities, that should be bound by the code.   Privacy codes  Part IIIB Registered APP codes  Division 2  Section 26GC  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a direction under that subsection may:  (a) specify one or more matters that the code must deal with; and  (b) specify the APP entities, or a class of APP entities, that should be bound by the code.   Privacy codes  Part IIIB Registered APP codes  Division 2  Section 26GC  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
