concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26gb-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26GB(7) Development of APP codes by the Commissioner—temporary"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-26gb-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) The period set out for the temporary APP code for the purposes of paragraph 26C(2)(c) must not be longer than 12 months. Note: Paragraph 26C(2)(c) deals with the period during which the code is in force. Disallowance" ;
    skos:definition "(7) The period set out for the temporary APP code for the purposes of paragraph 26C(2)(c) must not be longer than 12 months. Note: Paragraph 26C(2)(c) deals with the period during which the code is in force. Disallowance"@en ;
