concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26gc a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26GC Development of APP codes by the Commissioner—Children’s"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-26gc ;
    values:originalText "Online Privacy Code Children’s Online Privacy Code  (1) The Commissioner must develop an APP code (the Children’s Online Privacy Code) about online privacy for children." ;
    skos:definition "Online Privacy Code Children’s Online Privacy Code  (1) The Commissioner must develop an APP code (the Children’s Online Privacy Code) about online privacy for children."@en ;
