doc:sch-2-sec-26l a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "26L Entities to comply with the registered CR code if bound by the" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "code  If an entity is bound by the registered CR code, the entity must not do an act, or engage in a practice, that breaches the code. Note: There must always be one, and only one, registered CR code at all times after this Part commences: see subsection 26S(4)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "212"^^xsd:integer .

concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26m a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26M What is the registered CR code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-26m ;
    values:originalText "(1) The registered CR code is the CR code that is included on the Codes Register.  (2) The registered CR code is a legislative instrument.  (3) Subsection 12(2) (retrospective application of legislative instruments) of the Legislation Act 2003 does not apply to the registered CR code." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The registered CR code is the CR code that is included on the Codes Register.  (2) The registered CR code is a legislative instrument.  (3) Subsection 12(2) (retrospective application of legislative instruments) of the Legislation Act 2003 does not apply to the registered CR code."@en ;
