concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26n a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26N What is a CR code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-26n ;
    values:originalText "(1) A CR code is a written code of practice about credit reporting.  (2) A CR code must:  (a) set out how one or more of the provisions of Part IIIA are to be applied or complied with; and  (b) make provision for, or in relation to, matters required or permitted by Part IIIA to be provided for by the registered CR code; and  (c) bind all credit reporting bodies; and  (d) specify the credit providers that are bound by the code, or a way of determining which credit providers are bound; and   Privacy codes  Part IIIB Registered CR code  Division 3  Section 26P  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (e) specify any other entities subject to Part IIIA that are bound by the code, or a way of determining which of those entities are bound.  (3) A CR code may do one or more of the following:  (a) impose additional requirements to those imposed by" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A CR code is a written code of practice about credit reporting.  (2) A CR code must:  (a) set out how one or more of the provisions of Part IIIA are to be applied or complied with; and  (b) make provision for, or in relation to, matters required or permitted by Part IIIA to be provided for by the registered CR code; and  (c) bind all credit reporting bodies; and  (d) specify the credit providers that are bound by the code, or a way of determining which credit providers are bound; and   Privacy codes  Part IIIB Registered CR code  Division 3  Section 26P  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (e) specify any other entities subject to Part IIIA that are bound by the code, or a way of determining which of those entities are bound.  (3) A CR code may do one or more of the following:  (a) impose additional requirements to those imposed by"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "af3600e9552b37cda6cc377eadacdaca35ff6224a7eba6367bfa56625c3342da" ;
    cof:pageNumber "212"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26n-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26n-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26n-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
