concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26p a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26P Development of CR code by CR code developers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-26p ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commissioner may, in writing, request a CR code developer to develop a CR code and apply to the Commissioner for the code to be registered.  (2) The request must:  (a) specify the period within which the request must be complied with; and  (b) set out the effect of section 26L.  (3) The period:  (a) must run for at least 120 days from the date the request is made; and" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Commissioner may, in writing, request a CR code developer to develop a CR code and apply to the Commissioner for the code to be registered.  (2) The request must:  (a) specify the period within which the request must be complied with; and  (b) set out the effect of section 26L.  (3) The period:  (a) must run for at least 120 days from the date the request is made; and"@en ;
