concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26q a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26Q Application for registration of CR code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-26q ;
    values:originalText "(1) If a CR code developer develops a CR code, the developer may apply to the Commissioner for registration of the code.  (2) Before making the application, the CR code developer must:  (a) make a draft of the CR code publicly available; and  (b) invite the public to make submissions to the developer about the draft within a specified period (which must run for at least 28 days); and  (c) give consideration to any submissions made within the specified period.  (3) The application must:  (a) be made in the form and manner specified by the Commissioner; and  (b) be accompanied by such information as is specified by the Commissioner.  (4) The CR code developer may vary the CR code at any time before the Commissioner registers the code, but only with the consent of the Commissioner.   Privacy codes  Part IIIB Registered CR code  Division 3  Section 26R  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If a CR code developer develops a CR code, the developer may apply to the Commissioner for registration of the code.  (2) Before making the application, the CR code developer must:  (a) make a draft of the CR code publicly available; and  (b) invite the public to make submissions to the developer about the draft within a specified period (which must run for at least 28 days); and  (c) give consideration to any submissions made within the specified period.  (3) The application must:  (a) be made in the form and manner specified by the Commissioner; and  (b) be accompanied by such information as is specified by the Commissioner.  (4) The CR code developer may vary the CR code at any time before the Commissioner registers the code, but only with the consent of the Commissioner.   Privacy codes  Part IIIB Registered CR code  Division 3  Section 26R  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "40476412041d6c214667203767a12e5aafd0ed79b36c6cc6a3e1a58bc77d61d5" ;
    cof:pageNumber "214"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26q-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26q-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26q-ss-3 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26q-ss-4 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <entries-found-privacy-act-1988.pdf> ;
    dc:source "entries-found-privacy-act-1988.pdf, p.214" .
