doc:sch-2-sec-26q-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "26Q(3) Application for registration of CR code" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The application must:  (a) be made in the form and manner specified by the Commissioner; and  (b) be accompanied by such information as is specified by the Commissioner." ;
    cof:pageNumber "214"^^xsd:integer .

concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26q-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26Q(4) Application for registration of CR code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-26q-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The CR code developer may vary the CR code at any time before the Commissioner registers the code, but only with the consent of the Commissioner.   Privacy codes  Part IIIB Registered CR code  Division 3  Section 26R  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(4) The CR code developer may vary the CR code at any time before the Commissioner registers the code, but only with the consent of the Commissioner.   Privacy codes  Part IIIB Registered CR code  Division 3  Section 26R  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
