doc:sch-2-sec-26t-ss-7 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "26T(7) Variation of the registered CR code" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) An approval is not a legislative instrument. Note: The CR code, as varied, is a legislative instrument once it is included on the Codes Register: see section 26M." ;
