concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26wa a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26WA Guide to this Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-26wa ;
    values:originalText "• This Part sets up a scheme for notification of eligible data breaches. • An eligible data breach happens if:  (a) there is unauthorised access to, unauthorised disclosure of, or loss of, personal information held by an entity; and  (b) the access, disclosure or loss is likely to result in serious harm to any of the individuals to whom the information relates. • An entity must give a notification if:  (a) it has reasonable grounds to believe that an eligible data breach has happened; or  (b) it is directed to do so by the Commissioner. • The Commissioner may obtain information or documents in relation to actual or suspected eligible data breaches. • This Part also deals with the collection, use and disclosure of personal information involved in eligible data breaches." ;
    skos:definition "• This Part sets up a scheme for notification of eligible data breaches. • An eligible data breach happens if:  (a) there is unauthorised access to, unauthorised disclosure of, or loss of, personal information held by an entity; and  (b) the access, disclosure or loss is likely to result in serious harm to any of the individuals to whom the information relates. • An entity must give a notification if:  (a) it has reasonable grounds to believe that an eligible data breach has happened; or  (b) it is directed to do so by the Commissioner. • The Commissioner may obtain information or documents in relation to actual or suspected eligible data breaches. • This Part also deals with the collection, use and disclosure of personal information involved in eligible data breaches."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ea01622ad37389c1a35fce01194bf5b5c094ad36a08a084d5a47a1aa00047373" ;
    cof:pageNumber "220"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Notification of eligible data breaches is required." ;
    dc:description "Reasonable grounds to believe a breach has occurred or direction from the Commissioner." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <entries-found-privacy-act-1988.pdf> ;
    dc:source "entries-found-privacy-act-1988.pdf, p.220" ;
