concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26wq-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26WQ(6) Exception—declaration by Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-26wq-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) An application by an entity under paragraph (5)(b) may be expressed to be:  (a) an application for a paragraph (1)(c) declaration; or  (b) an application for a paragraph (1)(d) declaration; or  (c) an application for:  (i) a paragraph (1)(c) declaration; or  (ii) in the event that the Commissioner is not disposed to make such a declaration—a paragraph (1)(d) declaration." ;
    skos:definition "(6) An application by an entity under paragraph (5)(b) may be expressed to be:  (a) an application for a paragraph (1)(c) declaration; or  (b) an application for a paragraph (1)(d) declaration; or  (c) an application for:  (i) a paragraph (1)(c) declaration; or  (ii) in the event that the Commissioner is not disposed to make such a declaration—a paragraph (1)(d) declaration."@en ;
