doc:sch-2-sec-26xf-ss-7 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "26XF(7) Additional operation of this Division" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) This Division also has the effect it would have if a reference to a collection, use or disclosure were expressly confined to a collection, use or disclosure taking place in a Territory. Aliens" ;
    cof:pageNumber "250"^^xsd:integer .

concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26xf-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26XF(8) Additional operation of this Division"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-26xf-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) This Division also has the effect it would have if a reference to a collection, use or disclosure were expressly confined to:  (a) a collection, use or disclosure by an alien (within the meaning of paragraph 51(xix) of the Constitution); or  (b) a collection, use or disclosure of personal information about an alien (within the meaning of paragraph 51(xix) of the Constitution). External affairs" ;
    skos:definition "(8) This Division also has the effect it would have if a reference to a collection, use or disclosure were expressly confined to:  (a) a collection, use or disclosure by an alien (within the meaning of paragraph 51(xix) of the Constitution); or  (b) a collection, use or disclosure of personal information about an alien (within the meaning of paragraph 51(xix) of the Constitution). External affairs"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d70cabbcf5371ebc5ad7a18376a33799688337d003adaec7f5ae717c23b251f2" ;
    values:partOf concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26xf ;
