doc:sch-2-sec-28a-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "28A(1) Monitoring related functions of the Commissioner" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The following are the monitoring related functions of the Commissioner:   Functions of the Information Commissioner  Part IV Functions of Commissioner  Division 2  Section 28A  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (a) monitoring the security and accuracy of information held by an entity that is information to which Part IIIA applies;  (b) examining the records of entities to ensure that the entities:  (i) are not using information to which Part IIIA applies for unauthorised purposes; and  (ii) are taking adequate measures to prevent the unlawful disclosure of such information;  (c) examining the records of the Commissioner of Taxation to ensure that the Commissioner:  (i) is not using tax file number information for purposes beyond his or her powers; and  (ii) is taking adequate measures to prevent the unlawful disclosure of the tax file number information that he or she holds;  (d) evaluating compliance with the rules issued under section 17;  (e) monitoring the security and accuracy of tax file number information kept by file number recipients. Other matters" ;
    cof:pageNumber "254"^^xsd:integer .

concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-28a-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "28A(2) Monitoring related functions of the Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-28a-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The following are also the monitoring related functions of the Commissioner:  (a) examining a proposed Commonwealth law that would require or authorise acts or practices of an entity that might otherwise be interferences with the privacy of individuals, or which may otherwise have any adverse effects on the privacy of individuals;  (b) examining a proposal for data matching or linkage that may involve an interference with the privacy of individuals, or which may otherwise have any adverse effects on the privacy of individuals;  (c) ensuring that any adverse effects of the proposed law or the proposal on the privacy of individuals are minimised;  (d) undertaking research into, and monitoring developments in, data processing and technology (including data matching and" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The following are also the monitoring related functions of the Commissioner:  (a) examining a proposed Commonwealth law that would require or authorise acts or practices of an entity that might otherwise be interferences with the privacy of individuals, or which may otherwise have any adverse effects on the privacy of individuals;  (b) examining a proposal for data matching or linkage that may involve an interference with the privacy of individuals, or which may otherwise have any adverse effects on the privacy of individuals;  (c) ensuring that any adverse effects of the proposed law or the proposal on the privacy of individuals are minimised;  (d) undertaking research into, and monitoring developments in, data processing and technology (including data matching and"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "620f42bfa74f7980158d7b48ba5a38a7d5cb0dfda7ee0bcb950536e5add117c1" ;
