concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-33a-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "33A(6) Commissioner may share information with other authorities"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-33a-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) To avoid doubt, the Commissioner may share information or documents with a receiving body under this section whether or not the Commissioner is transferring a complaint or part of a complaint to the body." ;
