doc:sch-2-sec-33b-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "33B(2) Commissioner may disclose certain information if in the public" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) In determining under subsection (1) whether the Commissioner is satisfied that a disclosure is in the public interest, the Commissioner:  (a) must have regard to the following:  (i) the rights and interests of any complainant or respondent;  (ii) whether the disclosure will, or is likely to, prejudice any investigation the Commissioner is undertaking;  (iii) whether the disclosure will, or is likely to, disclose the personal information of any person;  (iv) whether the disclosure will, or is likely to, disclose any confidential commercial information;  (v) whether the Commissioner reasonably believes that the disclosure would be likely to prejudice one or more enforcement related activities conducted by or on behalf of an enforcement body; and  (b) may have regard to any other matter the Commissioner considers relevant." ;
    cof:pageNumber "264"^^xsd:integer .

concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-33b-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "33B(3) Commissioner may disclose certain information if in the public"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-33b-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) This section does not limit any other powers the Commissioner has to disclose information under this Act or any other law of the Commonwealth.   Functions of the Information Commissioner  Part IV Assessments by, or at the direction of, the Commissioner  Division 3A  Section 33C  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(3) This section does not limit any other powers the Commissioner has to disclose information under this Act or any other law of the Commonwealth.   Functions of the Information Commissioner  Part IV Assessments by, or at the direction of, the Commissioner  Division 3A  Section 33C  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "57804dd67599c9f95885ce7a5430cfd2f26a56e63e4f192d79b70cc23a2790f7" ;
    values:partOf concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-33b ;
