concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-33h a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "33H Commissioner’s powers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-33h ;
    values:originalText "Sections 44 (power to obtain information or documents) and 45 (power to examine witnesses) apply for the purposes of a public inquiry in the same way as those provisions apply to an investigation under Part V. Note 1: Other provisions may apply on their own terms, such as section 33B (Commissioner may disclose certain information if in the public interest etc.)." ;
    skos:definition "Sections 44 (power to obtain information or documents) and 45 (power to examine witnesses) apply for the purposes of a public inquiry in the same way as those provisions apply to an investigation under Part V. Note 1: Other provisions may apply on their own terms, such as section 33B (Commissioner may disclose certain information if in the public interest etc.)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "25a96dbb1d0333e2f8bbf6a642d051abd951d6175bd255f08415e1c4f81006ba" ;
    cof:pageNumber "270"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Sections 44 and 45 apply to a public inquiry in the same way as they do to an investigation under Part V." ;
