    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-37 ;
    values:originalText "The principal executive of an agency of a kind specified in column 1 of an item in the following table is the person specified in column 2 of the item:  Item Column 1 Agency Column 2 Principal executive Department The Secretary of the Department" ;
