concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-38 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "38 Conditions for making a representative complaint"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-38 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A representative complaint may be lodged under section 36 only if:  (a) the class members have complaints against the same person or entity; and  (b) all the complaints are in respect of, or arise out of, the same, similar or related circumstances; and   Investigations etc.  Part V Investigation of complaints and investigations on the Commissioner’s initiative" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A representative complaint may be lodged under section 36 only if:  (a) the class members have complaints against the same person or entity; and  (b) all the complaints are in respect of, or arise out of, the same, similar or related circumstances; and   Investigations etc.  Part V Investigation of complaints and investigations on the Commissioner’s initiative"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2093ba0e38e7fec79b54a8f74123249da1a105a82dae6c58666a4d02a92e9a09" ;
    cof:pageNumber "278"^^xsd:integer ;
