concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-38c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "38C Amendment of representative complaints"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-38c ;
    values:originalText "If the Commissioner is satisfied that a complaint could be dealt with as a representative complaint if the class of persons on whose behalf the complaint is lodged is increased, reduced or otherwise altered, the Commissioner may amend the complaint so that the complaint can be dealt with as a representative complaint.   Investigations etc.  Part V Investigation of complaints and investigations on the Commissioner’s initiative" ;
    skos:definition "If the Commissioner is satisfied that a complaint could be dealt with as a representative complaint if the class of persons on whose behalf the complaint is lodged is increased, reduced or otherwise altered, the Commissioner may amend the complaint so that the complaint can be dealt with as a representative complaint.   Investigations etc.  Part V Investigation of complaints and investigations on the Commissioner’s initiative"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9c9ab7c5a6df0541853d69b5dac7e24a96cb733f176e8cdb44bf84bd5b6c8053" ;
    cof:pageNumber "280"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Commissioner may amend complaint to allow for representative complaints under certain conditions." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
