    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) a complaint about an act or practice is made under section 36; and  (b) the Commissioner considers it is reasonably possible that the complaint may be conciliated successfully; the Commissioner must make a reasonable attempt to conciliate the complaint." ;
    cof:pageNumber "282"^^xsd:integer .

