concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-44 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "44 Power to obtain information and documents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-44 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If the Commissioner has reason to believe that a person has information or a document relevant to an investigation under this Division, the Commissioner may give to the person a written notice requiring the person:  (a) to give the information to the Commissioner in writing signed by the person or, in the case of a body corporate, by an officer of the body corporate; or  (b) to produce the document to the Commissioner. Note: For a failure to give information etc., see section 66.  (2) A notice given by the Commissioner under subsection (1) shall state:  (a) the place at which the information or document is to be given or produced to the Commissioner; and" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If the Commissioner has reason to believe that a person has information or a document relevant to an investigation under this Division, the Commissioner may give to the person a written notice requiring the person:  (a) to give the information to the Commissioner in writing signed by the person or, in the case of a body corporate, by an officer of the body corporate; or  (b) to produce the document to the Commissioner. Note: For a failure to give information etc., see section 66.  (2) A notice given by the Commissioner under subsection (1) shall state:  (a) the place at which the information or document is to be given or produced to the Commissioner; and"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6afb80901e5a517930a45ee37e33e6bba0e34e9c4a949477d8358e1ceb687c08" ;
    cof:pageNumber "287"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-44-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-44-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <entries-found-privacy-act-1988.pdf> ;
    dc:source "entries-found-privacy-act-1988.pdf, p.287" .
