concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-45 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "45 Power to examine witnesses"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-45 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commissioner may administer an oath or affirmation to a person required under section 44 to attend before the Commissioner and may examine such a person on oath or affirmation.   Investigations etc.  Part V Investigation of complaints and investigations on the Commissioner’s initiative" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Commissioner may administer an oath or affirmation to a person required under section 44 to attend before the Commissioner and may examine such a person on oath or affirmation.   Investigations etc.  Part V Investigation of complaints and investigations on the Commissioner’s initiative"@en ;
