concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-48 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "48 Complainant and certain other persons to be informed of various"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-48 ;
    values:originalText "matters  (1) Where the Commissioner decides not to investigate, or not to investigate further, a matter to which a complaint relates, the Commissioner shall, as soon as practicable and in such manner as the Commissioner thinks fit, inform the complainant and the respondent of the decision and of the reasons for the decision.   Investigations etc.  Part V Investigation of complaints and investigations on the Commissioner’s initiative" ;
    skos:definition "matters  (1) Where the Commissioner decides not to investigate, or not to investigate further, a matter to which a complaint relates, the Commissioner shall, as soon as practicable and in such manner as the Commissioner thinks fit, inform the complainant and the respondent of the decision and of the reasons for the decision.   Investigations etc.  Part V Investigation of complaints and investigations on the Commissioner’s initiative"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "40cdf769f236b9a3f4a5ff9dc895162ebd4db1d36b4fa7155bfa0885e0e6b556" ;
    cof:pageNumber "290"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Inform complainant and respondent of decision and reasons." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <entries-found-privacy-act-1988.pdf> ;
    dc:source "entries-found-privacy-act-1988.pdf, p.290" ;
