concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-50a-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "50A(4) Substitution of respondent to complaint"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-50a-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the Commissioner amends the complaint after starting to investigate it, the Commissioner is taken to have satisfied subsection 43(1A) in relation to the agency.   Investigations etc.  Part V Investigation of complaints and investigations on the Commissioner’s initiative" ;
    skos:definition "(4) If the Commissioner amends the complaint after starting to investigate it, the Commissioner is taken to have satisfied subsection 43(1A) in relation to the agency.   Investigations etc.  Part V Investigation of complaints and investigations on the Commissioner’s initiative"@en ;
