concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-53 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "53 Determination must identify the class members who are to be"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-53 ;
    values:originalText "affected by the determination  A determination under section 52 on a representative complaint must describe or otherwise identify those of the class members who are to be affected by the determination." ;
