concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-54 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "54 Application of Division"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-54 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This Division applies to a determination made under section 52 after the commencement of this Division, except where the determination applies in relation to an agency or the principal executive of an agency.  (2) In this section: agency does not include an eligible hearing service provider." ;
