doc:sch-2-sec-55a-ss-7a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "55A(7A) Proceedings in the Federal Court or Federal Circuit and Family" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7A) In conducting a hearing and making an order under this section, the court is to have due regard to the objects of this Act.   Investigations etc.  Part V Enforcement of determinations  Division 3  Section 55B  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "306"^^xsd:integer .

