concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-57 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "57 Application of Division"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-57 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This Division applies to a determination that is made under section 52 and that applies in relation to an agency or the principal executive of an agency.  (2) In this section: agency does not include an eligible hearing service provider." ;
