concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-62-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "62(5) Enforcement of determination against an agency"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-62-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) An application may not be made under this section in relation to a determination under section 52 until:  (a) the time has expired for making an application under section 96 for review of the determination; or  (b) if such an application is made, the decision of the Administrative Review Tribunal on the application has come into operation." ;
    skos:definition "(5) An application may not be made under this section in relation to a determination under section 52 until:  (a) the time has expired for making an application under section 96 for review of the determination; or  (b) if such an application is made, the decision of the Administrative Review Tribunal on the application has come into operation."@en ;
