    values:originalText "(3) A person shall not furnish information or make a statement to the Commissioner knowing that it is false or misleading in a material particular. Penalty for a contravention of this subsection: Imprisonment for 12 months or 20 penalty units, or both.   Investigations etc.  Part V Miscellaneous  Division 5  Section 66  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  66  Failure to give information etc. Basic contravention" ;
