concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-65-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "65(1) Failure to attend etc. before Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-65-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person contravenes this subsection if:  (a) the person is required to give information, answer a question or produce a document or record under this Act; and  (b) the person refuses or fails to do so. Civil penalty: 60 penalty units. Multiple contraventions  (1AA) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person is a corporation; and  (b) the person engages in conduct that constitutes a system of conduct or a pattern of behaviour; and  (c) the system of conduct or pattern of behaviour results in 2 or more contraventions of subsection (1). Penalty: 300 penalty units." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person contravenes this subsection if:  (a) the person is required to give information, answer a question or produce a document or record under this Act; and  (b) the person refuses or fails to do so. Civil penalty: 60 penalty units. Multiple contraventions  (1AA) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person is a corporation; and  (b) the person engages in conduct that constitutes a system of conduct or a pattern of behaviour; and  (c) the system of conduct or pattern of behaviour results in 2 or more contraventions of subsection (1). Penalty: 300 penalty units."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "681dad3ece0d13d2c0dda3f6ea82d02d29274471bf342cf0ac7b61ad839090c5" ;
    values:partOf concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-65 ;
    cof:pageNumber "312"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Refusal to attend before Commissioner is prohibited. Refusal to provide information or answer questions under the Act is prohibited." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
