concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-65-ss-1b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "65(1B) Failure to attend etc. before Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-65-ss-1b ;
    values:originalText "(1B) Subsection (1) or (1AA) does not apply if the person has a reasonable excuse. Note: A person who wishes to rely on this subsection bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in this subsection: see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code and section 96 of the Regulatory Powers Act." ;
    skos:definition "(1B) Subsection (1) or (1AA) does not apply if the person has a reasonable excuse. Note: A person who wishes to rely on this subsection bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in this subsection: see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code and section 96 of the Regulatory Powers Act."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "99e7c55c99ff7457ea97042e96b4cd2970f92f8bb4cd1ce68adc0dbf68d24778" ;
    values:partOf concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-65 ;
