concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-67 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "67 Protection from civil actions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-67 ;
    values:originalText "Civil proceedings do not lie against a person in respect of loss, damage or injury of any kind suffered by another person because of any of the following acts done in good faith:  (a) the making of a complaint under this Act;  (b) the making of a statement to, or the giving of a document or information to, the Commissioner." ;
    skos:definition "Civil proceedings do not lie against a person in respect of loss, damage or injury of any kind suffered by another person because of any of the following acts done in good faith:  (a) the making of a complaint under this Act;  (b) the making of a statement to, or the giving of a document or information to, the Commissioner."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f4d79ef40f218778c2ce2fc3a19359fd49b657db8b54bc5796d2f53d7c84790f" ;
