concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-73-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "73(4) Application by APP entity"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-73-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Where the Commissioner makes a determination under section 72 on an application made by virtue of subsection (2), that section has effect, in relation to each of the agencies on whose behalf the application was made as if the determination had been made on an application by that agency.   Public interest determinations and temporary public interest determinations  Part VI Public interest determinations  Division 1  Section 74  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(4) Where the Commissioner makes a determination under section 72 on an application made by virtue of subsection (2), that section has effect, in relation to each of the agencies on whose behalf the application was made as if the determination had been made on an application by that agency.   Public interest determinations and temporary public interest determinations  Part VI Public interest determinations  Division 1  Section 74  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3dda307413ed05c9a6450efeedee90fc0781739d66bd06b3bbc5f47c214f261d" ;
    values:partOf concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-73 ;
