    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) At the conference, a person to whom an invitation was sent, or any other person who is interested in the application and whose presence at the conference is considered by the Commissioner to be appropriate, is entitled to attend and participate personally or, in the case of a body corporate, to be represented by a person who is, or persons each of whom is, a director, officer or employee of the body corporate." ;
    cof:pageNumber "322"^^xsd:integer .

concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-77-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "77(3) Conduct of conference"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-77-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Commissioner may exclude from the conference a person who:   Public interest determinations and temporary public interest determinations  Part VI Public interest determinations  Division 1  Section 78  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (a) is entitled neither to participate in the conference nor to represent a person who is entitled to be represented at the conference;  (b) uses insulting language at the conference;  (c) creates, or takes part in creating or continuing, a disturbance at the conference; or  (d) repeatedly disturbs the conference." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The Commissioner may exclude from the conference a person who:   Public interest determinations and temporary public interest determinations  Part VI Public interest determinations  Division 1  Section 78  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (a) is entitled neither to participate in the conference nor to represent a person who is entitled to be represented at the conference;  (b) uses insulting language at the conference;  (c) creates, or takes part in creating or continuing, a disturbance at the conference; or  (d) repeatedly disturbs the conference."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "14eb7f0b34d0484fd4005bac298a95b18b3028ed1ae185a7fdc6eea76cce8405" ;
    values:partOf concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-77 ;
    cof:pageNumber "322"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exclude from conference a person who uses insulting language or creates/disturbs the conference." ;
