concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-79 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "79 Making of determination"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-79 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commissioner shall, in making a determination, take account of all matters raised at the conference.  (2) The Commissioner shall, in making a determination, take account of all submissions about the application that have been made, whether at a conference or not, by the agency, organisation or any other person." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Commissioner shall, in making a determination, take account of all matters raised at the conference.  (2) The Commissioner shall, in making a determination, take account of all submissions about the application that have been made, whether at a conference or not, by the agency, organisation or any other person."@en ;
