on services, medical or other treatment, health services and financial or other humanitarian assistance;  (c) assisting individuals who are or may be at risk of being involved in or affected by the emergency or disaster to obtain services such as repatriation services, medical or other" ;
    cof:pageNumber "330"^^xsd:integer .

