concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-80p-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80P(7) Authorisation of collection, use and disclosure of personal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-80p-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) In this section: designated secrecy provision means any of the following:  (a) sections 18, 18A, 18B, 34GF, 35P, 92 and 92A, and subsection 34GE(4), of the Australian Security Intelligence Organisation Act 1979;  (aa) section 15LC of the Crimes Act 1914;  (b) section 34 of the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security Act 1986;  (c) sections 39, 40C, 40D and 41 of, and clause 9 of Schedule 1 to, the Intelligence Services Act 2001;  (ca) sections 42 to 44 of the Office of National Intelligence Act 2018;  (cb) sections 22, 22A and 22B of the Witness Protection Act 1994;  (d) a provision of a Commonwealth law prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this paragraph;  (e) a provision of a Commonwealth law of a kind prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this paragraph." ;
    skos:definition "(7) In this section: designated secrecy provision means any of the following:  (a) sections 18, 18A, 18B, 34GF, 35P, 92 and 92A, and subsection 34GE(4), of the Australian Security Intelligence Organisation Act 1979;  (aa) section 15LC of the Crimes Act 1914;  (b) section 34 of the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security Act 1986;  (c) sections 39, 40C, 40D and 41 of, and clause 9 of Schedule 1 to, the Intelligence Services Act 2001;  (ca) sections 42 to 44 of the Office of National Intelligence Act 2018;  (cb) sections 22, 22A and 22B of the Witness Protection Act 1994;  (d) a provision of a Commonwealth law prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this paragraph;  (e) a provision of a Commonwealth law of a kind prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this paragraph."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4403eb54928326b2e0f99be34f5e90b6764dd99f31b030b8d5f337a80df25aba" ;
    values:partOf concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-80p ;
    cof:pageNumber "334"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "List of designated secrecy provisions" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
