concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-80q-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80Q(3) Disclosure of information—offence"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-80q-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If a disclosure of personal information is covered by subsection (2), the disclosure is authorised by this section.   Dealing with personal information in emergencies and disasters  Part VIA Other matters  Division 4  Section 80R  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
