    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of Part 3 of the Regulatory Powers Act, each of the following persons is an authorised applicant in relation to evidential material that relates to a provision mentioned in subsection (1):" ;
    skos:definition "(2) For the purposes of Part 3 of the Regulatory Powers Act, each of the following persons is an authorised applicant in relation to evidential material that relates to a provision mentioned in subsection (1):"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5dce5f2fcfdfed3a7ecea5b64f9ed7e9e026e0f7e132da8e2e47636d06e0efbf" ;
    values:partOf concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-80td ;
