concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-80ua a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80UA Powers of court to make other orders"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-80ua ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Federal Court, or the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2), may make an order under this section in proceedings if, in the proceedings, the Court has determined, or   Compliance and enforcement  Part VIB Civil penalties  Division 1  Section 80UA  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  will determine, under the Regulatory Powers Act that an entity has contravened a civil penalty provision of this Act (other than" ;
