doc:sch-2-sec-80ub-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "80UB(1) Infringement notices" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The following provisions are subject to an infringement notice under Part 5 of the Regulatory Powers Act:  (a) subsections 13K(1) and (2) (civil penalty provision for which infringement notices or compliance notices can be issued);  (b) subsection 66(1) (failure to give information);  (c) subsection 80UC(4) (failure to comply with a compliance notice). Note: Part 5 of the Regulatory Powers Act creates a framework for using infringement notices in relation to provisions. Amount to be stated in an infringement notice for listed companies—section 13K" ;
    cof:pageNumber "352"^^xsd:integer .

