    skos:definition "(1B) Despite subsection 104(3) of the Regulatory Powers Act, if an infringement notice relates to more than one alleged contravention of subsection 13K(1) or (2), or 80UC(4), by a listed corporation (within the meaning of the Corporations Act 2001), the amount to be stated in the notice for the purposes of paragraph 104(1)(f) of the Regulatory Powers Act is the number of penalty units worked out by multiplying the number of alleged contraventions by 200.   Compliance and enforcement  Part VIB Infringement notices  Division 1A  Section 80UB  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Infringement officer"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "76896c4acd7babd4132ec4d230637ddde067b6b786226eba34e7e9137613168b" ;
