    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Advisory Committee shall consist of:  (a) the Commissioner; and  (aa) the Privacy Commissioner (within the meaning of the Australian Information Commissioner Act 2010); and  (b) not more than 8 other members." ;
