concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-95 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "95 Medical research guidelines"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-95 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The CEO of the National Health and Medical Research Council may, with the approval of the Commissioner, issue guidelines for the protection of privacy by agencies in the conduct of medical research.  (2) The Commissioner shall not approve the issue of guidelines unless he or she is satisfied that the public interest in the promotion of research of the kind to which the guidelines relate outweighs to a substantial degree the public interest in maintaining adherence to the Australian Privacy Principles.  (3) Guidelines shall be issued by being published in the Gazette.  (4) Where:  (a) but for this subsection, an act done by an agency would breach an Australian Privacy Principle; and  (b) the act is done in the course of medical research and in accordance with guidelines under subsection (1); the act shall be regarded as not breaching that Australian Privacy Principle.   Miscellaneous  Part IX  Section 95A  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The CEO of the National Health and Medical Research Council may, with the approval of the Commissioner, issue guidelines for the protection of privacy by agencies in the conduct of medical research.  (2) The Commissioner shall not approve the issue of guidelines unless he or she is satisfied that the public interest in the promotion of research of the kind to which the guidelines relate outweighs to a substantial degree the public interest in maintaining adherence to the Australian Privacy Principles.  (3) Guidelines shall be issued by being published in the Gazette.  (4) Where:  (a) but for this subsection, an act done by an agency would breach an Australian Privacy Principle; and  (b) the act is done in the course of medical research and in accordance with guidelines under subsection (1); the act shall be regarded as not breaching that Australian Privacy Principle.   Miscellaneous  Part IX  Section 95A  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b39955e81631e336bd6a7153b53db19be4ca2edcf730ffa47def48664bd185c2" ;
    cof:pageNumber "366"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-95-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-95-ss-2 ;
