    skos:prefLabel "1 Section 1"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-1-6 ;
    values:originalText "5 An APP entity must take such steps as are reasonable in the circumstances to make its APP privacy policy available:  (a) free of charge; and  (b) in such form as is appropriate. Note: An APP entity will usually make its APP privacy policy available on the entity’s website." ;
    skos:definition "5 An APP entity must take such steps as are reasonable in the circumstances to make its APP privacy policy available:  (a) free of charge; and  (b) in such form as is appropriate. Note: An APP entity will usually make its APP privacy policy available on the entity’s website."@en ;
