concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-1-sec-2-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 2 Subclause 2.1 does not apply if, in relation to that matter:"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-2-3 ;
    values:originalText "(a) the APP entity is required or authorised by or under an Australian law, or a court/tribunal order, to deal with individuals who have identified themselves; or  Australian Privacy Principles  Schedule 1 Consideration of personal information privacy  Part 1  Clause 2  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (b) it is impracticable for the APP entity to deal with individuals who have not identified themselves or who have used a pseudonym.  Schedule 1  Australian Privacy Principles" ;
    skos:definition "(a) the APP entity is required or authorised by or under an Australian law, or a court/tribunal order, to deal with individuals who have identified themselves; or  Australian Privacy Principles  Schedule 1 Consideration of personal information privacy  Part 1  Clause 2  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (b) it is impracticable for the APP entity to deal with individuals who have not identified themselves or who have used a pseudonym.  Schedule 1  Australian Privacy Principles"@en ;
