concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-1-sec-4-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 1 If:"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-4-2 ;
    values:originalText "(a) an APP entity receives personal information; and  (b) the entity did not solicit the information; the entity must, within a reasonable period after receiving the information, determine whether or not the entity could have collected the information under Australian Privacy Principle 3 if the entity had solicited the information." ;
    skos:definition "(a) an APP entity receives personal information; and  (b) the entity did not solicit the information; the entity must, within a reasonable period after receiving the information, determine whether or not the entity could have collected the information under Australian Privacy Principle 3 if the entity had solicited the information."@en ;
