concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-1-sec-6-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 4 If:"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-6-5 ;
    values:originalText "(a) the APP entity is an organisation; and  (b) subsection 16B(2) applied in relation to the collection of the personal information by the entity; the entity must take such steps as are reasonable in the circumstances to ensure that the information is de-identified before the entity discloses it in accordance with subclause 6.1 or 6.2. Written note of use or disclosure" ;
    skos:definition "(a) the APP entity is an organisation; and  (b) subsection 16B(2) applied in relation to the collection of the personal information by the entity; the entity must take such steps as are reasonable in the circumstances to ensure that the information is de-identified before the entity discloses it in accordance with subclause 6.1 or 6.2. Written note of use or disclosure"@en ;
