doc:sch-1-sec-7-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "7 4 Despite subclause 7.1, an organisation may use or disclose" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "sensitive information about an individual for the purpose of direct marketing if the individual has consented to the use or disclosure of the information for that purpose.  Australian Privacy Principles  Schedule 1 Dealing with personal information  Part 3  Clause 7  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Exception—contracted service providers" ;
