concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-1-sec-7-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7 Section 7"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-7-9 ;
    values:originalText "8 This principle does not apply to the extent that any of the following apply:  (aa) Division 5 of Part 7B of the Interactive Gambling Act 2001;  (a) the Do Not Call Register Act 2006;  (b) the Spam Act 2003;  (c) any other Act of the Commonwealth, or a law in force in an external Territory, prescribed by the regulations." ;
    skos:definition "8 This principle does not apply to the extent that any of the following apply:  (aa) Division 5 of Part 7B of the Interactive Gambling Act 2001;  (a) the Do Not Call Register Act 2006;  (b) the Spam Act 2003;  (c) any other Act of the Commonwealth, or a law in force in an external Territory, prescribed by the regulations."@en ;
