doc:sch-1-sec-8-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "8 3 This subclause applies in relation to the disclosure of personal" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "information (the relevant personal information) about an individual by an APP entity to an overseas recipient if:  (a) the recipient of the relevant personal information is:  (i) subject to the laws of a country that is prescribed by the regulations; or  (ii) a participant in a binding scheme that is prescribed by the regulations; and  (b) if the country or binding scheme is prescribed subject to conditions—those conditions are satisfied. Note: There are prerequisites that must be satisfied before the matters mentioned in this subclause are prescribed: see subsection 100(1A)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "394"^^xsd:integer .

