doc:sch-1-sec-12-9 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "12 8 If:" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(a) the APP entity is an organisation; and  (b) the entity charges the individual for giving access to the personal information; the charge must not be excessive and must not apply to the making of the request. Refusal to give access" ;
