concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-1-sec-13-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "13 3 If the APP entity refuses to correct the personal information as"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-13-4 ;
    values:originalText "requested by the individual, the entity must give the individual a written notice that sets out:  (a) the reasons for the refusal except to the extent that it would be unreasonable to do so; and  (b) the mechanisms available to complain about the refusal; and  (c) any other matter prescribed by the regulations. Request to associate a statement" ;
    skos:definition "requested by the individual, the entity must give the individual a written notice that sets out:  (a) the reasons for the refusal except to the extent that it would be unreasonable to do so; and  (b) the mechanisms available to complain about the refusal; and  (c) any other matter prescribed by the regulations. Request to associate a statement"@en ;
