concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-4-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 Constitutional basis of this Schedule"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-4-2 ;
    values:originalText "This Schedule relies on the Commonwealth’s legislative powers under paragraph 51(xxix) of the Constitution to give effect to Australia’s obligations under the International Covenant on Civil and Political Rights." ;
    skos:definition "This Schedule relies on the Commonwealth’s legislative powers under paragraph 51(xxix) of the Constitution to give effect to Australia’s obligations under the International Covenant on Civil and Political Rights."@en ;
