    skos:prefLabel "10 Summary judgment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-10-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The court may give judgment for the defendant if the court is satisfied that the plaintiff has no reasonable prospect of successfully prosecuting the proceedings.  Statutory Tort for Serious Invasions of Privacy  Schedule 2 Serious invasions of privacy  Part 2  Clause 11  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (2) This clause does not limit any powers that the court has apart from this clause." ;
