doc:sch-2-sec-15-2-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "15(3) Journalists etc." ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Material is journalistic material if it:  (a) has the character of news, current affairs or a documentary; or  (b) consists of commentary or opinion on, or analysis of, news, current affairs or a documentary; or  Statutory Tort for Serious Invasions of Privacy  Schedule 2 Exemptions  Part 3  Clause 16  Privacy Act 1988  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (c) consists of editorial content relating to news, current affairs or a documentary." ;
    cof:pageNumber "416"^^xsd:integer .

concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-15-2-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15(4) Journalists etc."@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-15-2-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of this clause, if a journalist invades an individual’s privacy, it is immaterial whether the invasion of privacy breaches the standards or the code of practice to which the journalist is subject." ;
    skos:definition "(4) For the purposes of this clause, if a journalist invades an individual’s privacy, it is immaterial whether the invasion of privacy breaches the standards or the code of practice to which the journalist is subject."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d43fb5a040b75e25535ad87622ee037dc00b5e93f2bb8a14aef16e62c17fb43c" ;
    values:partOf concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-15-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "416"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Journalist's invasion of privacy is immaterial to standards or code of practice." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
