concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-16-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16 Agencies and State and Territory authorities (other than"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-16-2 ;
    values:originalText "intelligence agencies and law enforcement bodies)  This Schedule does not apply to an invasion of an individual’s privacy by an agency or a State or Territory authority (other than an intelligence agency or a law enforcement body) to the extent that the agency or authority invades the individual’s privacy, in good faith:  (a) in the performance or purported performance of a function of the agency or authority; or  (b) in the exercise or purported exercise of a power of the agency or authority." ;
    skos:definition "intelligence agencies and law enforcement bodies)  This Schedule does not apply to an invasion of an individual’s privacy by an agency or a State or Territory authority (other than an intelligence agency or a law enforcement body) to the extent that the agency or authority invades the individual’s privacy, in good faith:  (a) in the performance or purported performance of a function of the agency or authority; or  (b) in the exercise or purported exercise of a power of the agency or authority."@en ;
